<h1>Vessel structure</h1>
The structural parts of a Delta-glider, a Shuttle-PB and Atlantis (for
damage): their masses add up to the empty mass, they form a tree from the
core part at the origin, and the joints' strengths follow the load factor.
END_HYPERDESC

